   178	    - mapping, cards and distinct each hold the six draws;
   179	    - a matter is {matter: text, company_figure: a JSON boolean};
   180	    - a card holds exactly worth, answer, type, guardrail, covering and opened. A mark is a frozen mark or a split of two different ones;
   181	      an answer may be "no answer"; the guardrail is a JSON boolean; covering is a JSON boolean or "split"; opened is null or a day;
   182	    - a mapped matter is on the matter list, with a non-empty list of {question: a carded question of the draw, covers: true or "split"};
   183	    - a draw's distinct counts are ids, duplicates_both and duplicates_split: non-negative integers, the duplicates no more than the ids;
   184	    - matter_first_day maps every listed matter, and only those, to a day; a day is YYYY-MM-DD;
